# Build context lives at the workers/ repo root once the whisperx image
# starts copying `diarization/` in addition to `whisperx/`. Trim aggressively
# so the GitHub runner doesn't ship megabytes of unrelated files to the
# Docker daemon every push.

# Git plumbing — never needed inside the image.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# OS / editor cruft.
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.idea
**/.vscode

# Python build/test artifacts.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/venv

# Diarization fork extras the runtime doesn't need.
diarization/Whisper_Transcription_+_NeMo_Diarization.ipynb
diarization/tests
diarization/README.md
diarization/LICENSE

# CI / docs.
.github
**/*.md
